Z||000003||Capt Fiero||08-17-2001||04:55 PM||||The only catch is you need to remove the complete engine harness from the auto motor and put it on the stick motor.  I did that swap for my GF about 5 months ago.  (had a standard trans donar car and needed to put that motor in an auto car.  It is a pretty straight forward swap, the only things that get to be a pain are the wires that run between the valve covers and the intake pelunium.||||reg||1
